// Compaction + D-098: once the context passes 70% of where pi compacts, the summary is written in
// the background while the agent is idle, and compaction only adds what came after it. Compare
// against `compaction` on runs that compacted: success, and the time compaction held the agent.
{
	"modules": {
		"compaction": { "enabled": true, "earlySummary": true }
	}
}
